This product includes the `cove` skill, an implementation and adaptation of the
Chain-of-Verification (CoVe) method for agentic software engineering tasks.

The Chain-of-Verification method is described in:

  Shehzaad Dhuliawala, Mojtaba Komeili, Jing Xu, Roberta Raileanu, Xian Li,
  Asli Celikyilmaz, and Jason Weston. 2024. "Chain-of-Verification Reduces
  Hallucination in Large Language Models." In Findings of the Association for
  Computational Linguistics: ACL 2024, pages 3563-3578, Bangkok, Thailand.
  DOI: 10.18653/v1/2024.findings-acl.212
  https://aclanthology.org/2024.findings-acl.212/

